cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pysampler in academic work, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "pysampler: CUDA volume sampler for Volumetric Neural Representations"
abstract: >-
  pysampler is a pybind11 extension that exposes a unified Sampler over
  CUDA tex3D, OpenVKL, and OWL/OptiX backends, with zero-copy access to
  caller-owned CUDA buffers (e.g. PyTorch tensors). It is designed to
  accelerate the training of Volumetric Neural Representations (VNRs).
authors:
